# K03 NS-ROLES-2 REQUIRED POSITIVE, red until its dependency is built (Codex K03-NS2-COVERAGE-20261007-21;
# steps/defects.md#reference-field-consumers).
# A factory's captured Structure whose field box is the binding `box: Inner`: read's probe(loc\box) passes the
# Structure box references (item 738: a reference is not a Structure field to copy).  Today a path through a reference
# field is no Structure actual: "a field path must end at a Structure" (unit_capture_struct_field_struct_refused keeps
# its refusal with an owned nested field).  Exit 7: probe's 5 and read's 2; 81 otherwise.
Inner:
    int: c 5
end: Inner
Model:
    int: other 5
    box: Inner
    int: count 0
    int: value 0
end: Model
fn: probe (Inner: q) int
    return: q\c
fn: makeReader (int: n) fn: (int: x) int
    loc: merge: Model
    loc\value: n
    fn: read (int: x) int
        return: probe(loc\box) + x
    return: read
@: r40 makeReader(40)
int: a (r40: 2)
if: a != 7
    sendMessage: exit(exit_code: 81; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
    return
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: 7; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
